Petitioner has relied upon the following documents viz:-
"Ex PW1/1 is the DAR;
Ex.PW1/2 is the copy of discharge summary and treatment record;
Ex.PW1/3 are copies of medical bills and same are de-exhibited as Mark A; Ex.
PW1/4 (OSR) is copy of Aadhar Card of PW-1.''

He relied upon the following documents:-
"Ex. R3W1 is copy of insurance policy; Ex. R3W1/2 to Ex. R3W1/5 is copy of notice alongwith postal receipts;
Ex. R3W1/6 is verification report of DL filed by the IO alongwith DAR;
Ex.R3W1/7 (Colly0 is the original verification report dated 22.02.2015 obtained by insurance.''
